{"id":"97e929795d778cd6","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-arithmetic-language.md","title":"Arithmetic Signature and Numerals","display":"df-arithmetic-language — Arithmetic Signature and Numerals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-arithmetic-language","aliases":["67-df-arithmetic-language"],"display":"df-arithmetic-language — Arithmetic Signature and Numerals","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-arithmetic-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-arithmetic-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-language — Arithmetic Signature and Numerals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\times\">\\(0,S,+,\\times\\)</span> 是四个不同的函数符号；等号取逻辑等号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 为算术项。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在对象语言处表示常元项与一元函数构造，在元层数值处按类型区分；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 每次由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{var}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(t))\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{var}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(t))\\)</span> 选取。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在对象语言公式内写出的自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 缩写本条定义的数词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar m\">\\(\\bar m\\)</span>；元层函数输入、元数、下标中的自然数仍是元层对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A=L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(L_A=L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，两者表示同一签名。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nF_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,\\times\\},&amp;R_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\na_A(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;a_A(S)&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;a_A(+)&amp;\\coloneqq2,&amp;a_A(\\times)&amp;\\coloneqq2,\\\\\nL_A&amp;\\coloneqq(F_A,R_A,a_A),&amp;L_{\\mathrm{arith}}&amp;\\coloneqq L_A,\\\\\n\\bar0&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\overline{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\\\\ns\\le t&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z(s+z=t),&amp;s&lt;t&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z(s+Sz=t),\\\\\ns\\ne t&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(s=t),&amp;\\top&amp;\\coloneqq(0=0),&amp;\\bot&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(0=0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nF_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,\\times\\},&amp;R_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\na_A(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;a_A(S)&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;a_A(+)&amp;\\coloneqq2,&amp;a_A(\\times)&amp;\\coloneqq2,\\\\\nL_A&amp;\\coloneqq(F_A,R_A,a_A),&amp;L_{\\mathrm{arith}}&amp;\\coloneqq L_A,\\\\\n\\bar0&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\overline{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\\\\ns\\le t&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z(s+z=t),&amp;s&lt;t&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z(s+Sz=t),\\\\\ns\\ne t&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(s=t),&amp;\\top&amp;\\coloneqq(0=0),&amp;\\bot&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(0=0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条只给出后续条目实际使用的接口；所有数学条件均已列入前两节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"0,S,+,\\times","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{var}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(t))","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar m","display":false},{"tex":"L_A=L_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nF_A&\\coloneqq\\{0,S,+,\\times\\},&R_A&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\na_A(0)&\\coloneqq0,&a_A(S)&\\coloneqq1,&a_A(+)&\\coloneqq2,&a_A(\\times)&\\coloneqq2,\\\\\nL_A&\\coloneqq(F_A,R_A,a_A),&L_{\\mathrm{arith}}&\\coloneqq L_A,\\\\\n\\bar0&\\coloneqq0,&\\overline{n+1}&\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\\\\ns\\le t&\\coloneqq\\exists z(s+z=t),&s<t&\\coloneqq\\exists z(s+Sz=t),\\\\\ns\\ne t&\\coloneqq\\neg(s=t),&\\top&\\coloneqq(0=0),&\\bot&\\coloneqq\\neg(0=0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1635,"backlinks":[{"id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9a1432082607876a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}$ 无语言下标时仅缩写 $\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}$；$L_A$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetic-language]]。"},{"id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_A$、数词与派生连接词取 [[67-df-arithmetic-language]]、[[67-df-formula]]。$x=v_0,y=v_1$。"},{"id":"a0cb59478595f5c6","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi_1$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]；$R$ 为候选算术句，$p,q$ 是各异新鲜变量。$\\exists q<S p\\,\\psi$ 使用 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]] 的严格有界量词构造，$S p$ 是 [[67-df-arithmetic-language]] 的后继项。"},{"id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_A=L_{\\mathrm{arith}}$，$\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}$、$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}$、同时无捕获代入及 $\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetic-language]]、[[67-df-formula]]。下文 $x,y,z,u$ 遍历变量；$\\varphi,\\psi$ 遍历算术公式。对象量词的域由公式中的相对化指定。"},{"id":"cb812f5c5aa42196","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=L_A$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetic-language]]；$\\mathbb N_A\\in\\mathrm{Str}_{L_A}$ 是 [[67-df-satisfaction]] 指定的标准算术结构，$\\models_{L_A}$ 为同一满足关系。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-arithmetic-language]] — Arithmetic Signature and Numerals。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-arithmetic-language]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-arithmetic-language]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9"]}